   "questions": [
    "Is the router's declared extractor and `check_token` resolver an executable route dependency, in addition to the handler's own authentication, or is it emitted but deliberately unbound and never invoked?",
    "Is the router's declared resolver actually invoked by the generated routing framework, or is it only an unused declaration while each `deliverer_api` handler performs the sole extraction and `check_token` call?",
    "Does the router invoke its declared `check_token` resolver for protected routes, in addition to the handler invoking `check_token`, or is that declaration inert and authentication performed only by `deliverer_api`?"
