   "judgement": {
    "kind": "answered",
    "quotes": [
     "The router declares its extractor of the `Authorization` field and names `check_token` as the\nresolver of its one principal, but no route it serves calls them: the health route needs no token, and\nevery route that does is a handler of `deliverer_api`, which reads the field and calls `check_token`\nitself, before the project id or the body."
    ],
